WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 22=

01:59.100 --> 01:59.930
You still

02:00.900 --> 02:02.130
carry a knife around?

02:23.570 --> 02:25.410
Is this how Sheng'an welcomes
its guests?

02:29.130 --> 02:29.940
Without an audience at court

02:31.220 --> 02:31.940
there are to be no private visits.

02:33.100 --> 02:33.730
General Meng,

02:34.610 --> 02:35.820
don't you know the rules?

02:37.380 --> 02:38.340
A military governor

02:39.130 --> 02:40.010
must attend court

02:41.010 --> 02:42.260
before requesting a private audience.

02:42.940 --> 02:43.980
How cold.

02:46.130 --> 02:48.540
Tonight, I'm not the governor
paying respects to Your Highness.

02:49.690 --> 02:50.660
I'm here as an old friend

02:51.130 --> 02:52.100
to visit my old friend.

02:54.290 --> 02:54.730
What,

02:56.010 --> 02:57.100
not happy to see an old friend?

02:57.660 --> 02:58.690
You have no friends here!

03:02.780 --> 03:04.690
You won't get the better of me.

03:10.540 --> 03:11.450
Blades are dangerous.

03:13.170 --> 03:14.100
You'd better calm down.

03:21.340 --> 03:22.340
You may be heartless,

03:23.890 --> 03:25.100
but I can't be ungrateful.

03:30.340 --> 03:32.980
Back in North Jing, I often wondered

03:34.570 --> 03:35.780
how you'd fare

03:37.820 --> 03:38.730
after returning to the capital.

03:40.660 --> 03:42.380
Would you lie awake at night,

03:45.170 --> 03:45.980
haunted by the man you'd killed?

03:47.450 --> 03:48.130
As you can see,

03:49.170 --> 03:49.980
I'm doing just fine.

03:51.610 --> 03:52.260
Really?

03:54.010 --> 03:54.940
If you're doing well,

03:56.060 --> 03:57.260
then I'm happy for you.

03:58.890 --> 03:59.429
But...

03:59.471 --> 03:59.961
Your Highness?

04:04.570 --> 04:05.220
Who's there?

04:12.730 --> 04:13.290
It's me.

04:28.900 --> 04:30.370
Your Highness, are you still awake?

04:30.900 --> 04:31.730
Yan Shang requests an audience.

04:37.850 --> 04:39.460
So, it's your new favorite.

04:40.780 --> 04:41.700
While I was away,

04:42.490 --> 04:43.700
he kept you company.

04:44.370 --> 04:46.020
I suppose he deserves some credit.

04:47.340 --> 04:48.170
Why not let him in

04:49.370 --> 04:50.370
so I can thank him?

04:51.050 --> 04:52.020
I didn't summon you.

04:52.220 --> 04:52.850
What brings you here?

04:56.810 --> 04:59.490
You seem troubled tonight,
Your Highness.

05:00.370 --> 05:02.020
I was worried you wouldn't sleep well,

05:02.610 --> 05:03.460
so I came to see

05:04.140 --> 05:05.079
if you needed anything.

05:05.121 --> 05:05.601
No, thank you.

05:15.540 --> 05:16.580
I'm worried about you.

05:17.370 --> 05:18.140
May I come in?

05:25.660 --> 05:26.370
I'm tired.

05:26.730 --> 05:27.490
I'm turning in.

05:28.930 --> 05:29.540
Go back.

05:30.020 --> 05:30.490
Do as I say.

05:37.980 --> 05:39.050
You're tired and troubled.

05:39.850 --> 05:41.220
This is when you need me most.

05:42.730 --> 05:44.410
Why send me away?

05:45.100 --> 05:45.490
Unless...

05:46.020 --> 05:47.100
You've grown tired of me

05:47.410 --> 05:48.290
and found someone else.

05:49.250 --> 05:50.410
Why make it so hard?

05:52.250 --> 05:53.580
Let him in to join us.

05:54.660 --> 05:55.540
What's the harm?

05:59.460 --> 06:00.220
Will you ever stop?

06:01.410 --> 06:02.700
I'm tired. Can't you understand?

06:04.050 --> 06:04.490
Your Highness...

06:04.540 --> 06:05.780
Keep this up,
and you'll never see me again.

06:06.220 --> 06:06.610
Go back now!

06:14.730 --> 06:15.100
Understood.

06:16.410 --> 06:17.140
As you wish.

06:35.580 --> 06:37.460
Why must you be so harsh?

06:42.170 --> 06:44.020
I almost feel sorry for that poor lad.

06:45.370 --> 06:46.540
I have no time for your nonsense.

06:48.980 --> 06:50.580
What exactly do you want?

06:51.250 --> 06:52.410
Once you're back in North Jing with me,

06:53.810 --> 06:55.100
you really should learn

06:55.850 --> 06:57.170
to control that temper of yours.

06:57.410 --> 06:58.490
Who said I'd go back with you?

07:01.660 --> 07:02.980
You've got quite a short memory.

07:05.290 --> 07:07.340
Who was flirting with me back then?

07:08.020 --> 07:09.490
Who begged me to take her away?

07:11.100 --> 07:12.340
Wasn't it you?

07:23.850 --> 07:25.250
You certainly have a way with stories.

07:26.370 --> 07:27.100
But never mind.

07:28.580 --> 07:29.610
Since I returned to the capital,

07:30.220 --> 07:31.700
I've been the subject

07:32.410 --> 07:34.250
of countless rumors.

07:35.460 --> 07:36.460
And yours is hardly

07:36.980 --> 07:37.490
the strangest.

07:41.900 --> 07:43.580
Me, flirting with you?

07:46.340 --> 07:47.140
Go ahead and spread that story.

07:48.250 --> 07:49.810
Let's see how long the teahouses here

07:50.140 --> 07:50.900
gossip about it.

08:00.410 --> 08:02.660
Let's see how long
the secrets from North Jing

08:05.340 --> 08:06.930
keep Sheng'an buzzing.

08:12.980 --> 08:14.140
Given our history,

08:14.660 --> 08:16.370
let's cut to the chase.

08:17.460 --> 08:18.610
You can stay in Sheng'an,

08:18.900 --> 08:20.700
live in luxury
and keep your male favorites.

08:22.780 --> 08:24.900
Is it really because
your father dotes on you?

08:26.250 --> 08:28.410
Or because your title
as Princess Danyang

08:29.730 --> 08:31.250
makes you too valuable to touch?

08:35.220 --> 08:36.490
It's simply because

08:36.850 --> 08:37.940
you're a bargaining chip.

08:41.010 --> 08:42.460
We made a deal before.

08:43.420 --> 08:45.650
I'm just here to claim what I'm owed.

08:47.890 --> 08:48.820
Go ahead and try me.

08:54.530 --> 08:55.340
What if...

09:00.580 --> 09:02.490
I'd killed Meng Baiyu for you back then?

09:05.610 --> 09:07.340
Would we be together now?

09:08.700 --> 09:09.250
General Meng,

09:10.250 --> 09:11.100
things have changed.

09:11.530 --> 09:12.340
You should know that.

09:13.340 --> 09:15.180
Living in Sheng'an costs a fortune now.

09:16.820 --> 09:17.770
My price

09:18.530 --> 09:19.490
isn't what it used to be.

09:20.770 --> 09:21.650
Let's hear it.

09:22.490 --> 09:23.460
Kill Yu Cheng'an for me,

09:23.820 --> 09:24.460
and then we'll talk.

09:30.650 --> 09:31.700
Yu Cheng'an?

09:32.370 --> 09:34.060
You think killing Meng Baiyu was enough?

09:35.850 --> 09:37.580
Shouldn't the mastermind die too?

09:37.940 --> 09:39.530
So you hated Meng Baiyu

09:40.850 --> 09:42.130
not because you cared for me,

09:43.580 --> 09:44.980
but because you truly hated him.

09:45.340 --> 09:45.820
Of course.

09:47.820 --> 09:50.010
So you never had feelings for me.

09:52.060 --> 09:53.580
It was all a lie.

09:53.940 --> 09:54.490
That's right.

09:56.220 --> 09:57.420
You only figured that out now?

10:03.100 --> 10:04.940
I was only humoring you back then.

10:05.580 --> 10:06.010
Using you.

10:07.010 --> 10:07.770
I got close to you

10:08.610 --> 10:09.730
just to kill your uncle.

10:11.100 --> 10:13.220
Too bad I failed to kill you as well.

10:23.420 --> 10:24.370
Have you forgotten?

10:25.770 --> 10:26.850
When you left North Jing,

10:27.820 --> 10:28.980
you told me

10:29.610 --> 10:30.940
that I killed Meng Baiyu.

10:31.890 --> 10:32.940
Otherwise, how else

10:33.370 --> 10:34.770
would I have taken his place?

10:54.250 --> 10:54.650
Your Highness,

10:55.460 --> 10:55.890
it's me again.

10:58.850 --> 10:59.650
I've thought it over and over,

11:00.340 --> 11:01.300
but I still can't rest easy.

11:03.530 --> 11:04.220
Are you asleep?

11:08.730 --> 11:09.300
I'm coming in.

11:52.980 --> 11:53.530
Yan Shang,

11:54.130 --> 11:55.060
you've gone too far.

11:55.460 --> 11:55.980
Your Highness.

11:59.820 --> 12:00.650
Why is it you again?

12:01.420 --> 12:02.980
May I ask who you are, sir?

12:08.340 --> 12:08.770
Your Highness.

12:09.250 --> 12:10.100
You refused to see me

12:10.530 --> 12:12.060
so you could meet him here in secret?

12:12.650 --> 12:13.250
Show some respect!

12:14.650 --> 12:16.940
This is Military Governor Meng Zaishi

12:17.730 --> 12:18.730
of North Jing's Central Circuit.

12:21.610 --> 12:22.890
And this is Yan Shang,
this year's third-ranked scholar.

12:24.060 --> 12:25.100
I haven't taught him well.

12:25.610 --> 12:26.730
Please forgive his rudeness.

12:28.890 --> 12:30.180
Apologize to General Meng at once.

12:31.850 --> 12:34.100
Since you and Her Highness go way back,

12:34.530 --> 12:35.770
why did you frighten her

12:36.340 --> 12:37.100
at the night market earlier?

12:38.370 --> 12:39.460
This third-ranked scholar

12:40.010 --> 12:41.980
has to get to the bottom of things.

12:44.100 --> 12:45.490
You've spoiled him rotten.

12:45.770 --> 12:46.490
I already apologized.

12:47.010 --> 12:48.100
Please forgive his rudeness.

12:49.340 --> 12:50.370
When I was in North Jing,

12:50.980 --> 12:52.940
General Meng looked after me.
We were quite close.

12:53.980 --> 12:54.850
After such a long separation,

12:55.300 --> 12:56.460
we were just joking around.

12:57.300 --> 12:58.180
Yet you took it seriously.

13:00.530 --> 13:01.820
Your Highness knows so many people.

13:02.220 --> 13:03.420
Can you blame me for being suspicious?

13:04.100 --> 13:04.580
Enough.

13:05.220 --> 13:06.730
Watch your mouth
in front of General Meng.

13:07.580 --> 13:08.370
Have you no sense of propriety?

13:11.580 --> 13:12.490
General Meng, forgive me.

13:20.100 --> 13:20.610
It's late.

13:21.700 --> 13:23.180
Thanks for visiting me, General Meng.

13:23.530 --> 13:25.130
Perhaps you should head back now.

13:40.650 --> 13:41.890
You really care about him, huh?

13:43.610 --> 13:44.530
You came to see me

13:45.130 --> 13:45.890
without first attending court.

13:46.700 --> 13:47.650
That's a serious offense itself.

13:48.890 --> 13:50.420
If someone gets killed in my residence,

13:53.010 --> 13:54.180
do you think you'll make it back
to North Jing?

14:17.530 --> 14:18.460
Let him see me out.

14:19.700 --> 14:20.109
I'll do it...

14:20.151 --> 14:21.321
Allow me to see the General out.

14:31.180 --> 14:32.370
I'll come by again in a few days.

14:35.340 --> 14:36.490
Don't let a new favorite

14:37.730 --> 14:38.460
make you forget the old.

15:26.490 --> 15:26.820
Please.

15:32.250 --> 15:33.060
Come to think of it,

15:33.940 --> 15:35.460
I really should thank you.

15:36.890 --> 15:38.220
What for, General Meng?

15:40.460 --> 15:42.250
You're quite good at keeping her happy.

15:43.370 --> 15:44.940
While she's temporarily staying
in Sheng'an,

15:45.580 --> 15:46.650
knowing you're looking after her

15:47.250 --> 15:47.940
puts my mind at ease.

15:50.060 --> 15:51.010
You're too kind, General Meng.

15:51.820 --> 15:53.250
Sheng'an has always been her home.

15:53.730 --> 15:54.770
It's hardly a temporary stay.

15:55.650 --> 15:56.730
The Princess is of noble birth

15:57.130 --> 15:59.010
and the pride of the Huai.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.220
What a sharp tongue.

16:02.420 --> 16:03.700
So that's her type now.

16:05.770 --> 16:06.770
Mu Wanyao's temper

16:07.530 --> 16:08.250
isn't easy to deal with.

16:09.100 --> 16:09.820
Thanks for looking after her.

16:11.610 --> 16:12.060
It's my pleasure.

16:12.650 --> 16:14.890
In Sheng'an, hundreds upon hundreds

16:15.180 --> 16:16.100
admire Princess Danyang.

16:16.490 --> 16:18.010
To serve Her Highness up close

16:18.370 --> 16:19.890
is a blessing from a past life.

16:20.370 --> 16:21.650
Don't let her spoiled ways fool you.

16:22.490 --> 16:23.700
She has a lot on her mind.

16:25.730 --> 16:27.340
Does she still toss and turn at night,

16:28.650 --> 16:29.610
unable to sleep?

16:32.180 --> 16:33.490
Getting her to sleep is no easy feat.

16:34.130 --> 16:34.850
Third-Place Scholar,

16:35.890 --> 16:36.730
look after her well.

16:40.460 --> 16:41.820
Thanks for your concern.

16:42.530 --> 16:43.180
With me around,

16:43.770 --> 16:45.180
Her Highness always sleeps soundly.

16:52.650 --> 16:53.340
Watch your step.

17:10.380 --> 17:10.660
(Tierong, Meng Zaishi's personal guard)
General.

17:12.290 --> 17:12.620
General.

17:15.860 --> 17:16.330
Let's go.

17:17.380 --> 17:17.700
Go back.

17:17.940 --> 17:18.250
General,

17:19.050 --> 17:19.730
we've just received word.

17:19.980 --> 17:20.700
An incense stick ago,

17:20.940 --> 17:23.620
Governor Mu Xianqing of the Eastern
Circuit arrived outside Sheng'an.

17:25.180 --> 17:25.530
General,

17:25.940 --> 17:26.730
Mu Xianqing thinks

17:27.050 --> 17:29.140
you're still in North Jing.

17:30.330 --> 17:32.140
With his ragtag troops,

17:32.980 --> 17:34.530
he thinks he can keep me
out of the capital?

17:35.620 --> 17:36.220
What a joke.

17:36.700 --> 17:37.140
Exactly.

17:37.730 --> 17:39.010
He has no say

17:39.220 --> 17:40.220
in whether you come to Sheng'an.

17:41.420 --> 17:42.620
That old fool thinks

17:43.860 --> 17:45.309
that without the court's appointment

17:45.351 --> 17:46.311
and the Emperor's investiture,

17:46.810 --> 17:49.460
my claim to Meng Baiyu's post
is illegitimate.

17:50.180 --> 17:51.250
Let him keep thinking

17:51.860 --> 17:53.090
I won't make it in time
for the Longevity Festival

17:53.700 --> 17:54.620
or get to see the Emperor.

17:58.810 --> 17:59.490
Tierong.

18:01.050 --> 18:02.290
Tell me, what's so special

18:04.570 --> 18:05.940
about Sheng'an anyway?

18:30.420 --> 18:35.020
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

18:38.770 --> 18:39.180
Your Highness.

18:39.180 --> 18:42.090
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

18:42.090 --> 18:42.730
I'm fine.

18:44.660 --> 18:50.670
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

18:51.130 --> 18:56.070
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

18:59.180 --> 19:03.020
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

19:04.090 --> 19:04.980
Did he hurt you?

19:05.700 --> 19:06.900
You were too reckless earlier.

19:07.460 --> 19:08.250
You scared me.

19:08.380 --> 19:09.620
You scared me more.

19:10.810 --> 19:11.330
You know,

19:11.770 --> 19:13.700
I can always tell
when you don't mean it.

19:14.570 --> 19:15.250
When you're in danger,

19:16.220 --> 19:17.140
how could I not know?

19:18.090 --> 19:20.330
He's a vicious wolf from North Jing.

19:20.980 --> 19:22.330
He's capable of anything.

19:23.220 --> 19:25.380
He was plotting to kill you just now.

19:25.940 --> 19:26.770
Do you know?

19:26.870 --> 19:29.480
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

19:29.530 --> 19:30.330
He's a vicious wolf.

19:31.490 --> 19:33.010
All the more reason
I can't leave you alone.

19:33.720 --> 19:40.430
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

19:41.300 --> 19:44.620
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

19:44.820 --> 19:48.289
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

19:48.331 --> 19:54.931
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

19:56.250 --> 19:56.770
What's wrong?

19:57.230 --> 19:59.480
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

19:59.530 --> 20:01.290
Just like the day I shot Zheng Xing,

20:03.420 --> 20:04.730
having you by my side

20:05.940 --> 20:06.530
feels wonderful.

20:09.950 --> 20:13.070
♪- Be my one and only in this world
- Be my one and only in this life♪

20:13.480 --> 20:15.360
♪My last untouched innocence♪

20:17.230 --> 20:20.920
♪- If there's still
- Some warmth left in this world♪

20:22.390 --> 20:24.670
♪You're the only one I need♪

21:03.220 --> 21:04.660
Your Majesty, it's past the hour of Mao.

21:04.770 --> 21:05.380
We must hurry.

21:06.090 --> 21:07.090
I know.

21:07.460 --> 21:08.220
Stop nagging!

21:08.330 --> 21:09.220
What's all the fuss?

21:09.620 --> 21:10.220
Get out!

21:13.380 --> 21:14.530
Aren't you tired?

21:15.050 --> 21:16.380
I'm even more exhausted than you!

21:28.700 --> 21:30.090
Longevity Festival.

21:34.940 --> 21:36.900
Long live the Emperor...

21:44.570 --> 21:45.770
Line up by rank.

21:46.010 --> 21:46.710
(Zheng Qian,
Secretary of Ministry of Rites)

21:46.710 --> 21:47.250
One at a time. No pushing.

21:57.010 --> 21:57.980
Meng Zaishi?

21:59.940 --> 22:01.290
I remember our teacher saying

22:02.090 --> 22:04.530
North Jing once had three circuits:
East, West, and Central.

22:04.900 --> 22:06.220
The Eastern Circuit
was always the strongest.

22:06.900 --> 22:09.220
Its military governor, Mu Xianqing,
is of the imperial clan.

22:10.250 --> 22:11.860
Yuan Jia, military governor
of the Western Circuit,

22:12.050 --> 22:13.900
always followed Mu Xianqing's lead.

22:14.660 --> 22:15.250
But then,

22:15.770 --> 22:17.420
the Central Circuit wiped him out.

22:18.330 --> 22:19.330
Isn't the Central Circuit

22:20.050 --> 22:21.530
where the Princess was married off?

22:24.940 --> 22:26.220
After its governor Meng Baiyu died,

22:26.660 --> 22:27.900
his cousin's son, Meng Zaishi,

22:28.250 --> 22:29.420
took over as military governor.

22:30.140 --> 22:31.620
He killed Yuan Jia himself.

22:33.090 --> 22:34.140
So it seems

22:34.660 --> 22:36.180
there are now two rival powers
in North Jing:

22:36.860 --> 22:38.700
Mu Xianqing and Meng Zaishi.

22:40.290 --> 22:42.420
The Eastern Circuit is powerful
and claims legitimacy.

22:43.050 --> 22:45.380
It's long had its eye
on the Mengs' territory.

22:48.180 --> 22:49.770
Looks like someone else

22:50.460 --> 22:51.900
is the one losing sleep,

22:53.050 --> 22:54.010
Meng Zaishi.

22:58.940 --> 23:00.770
This wine set must go before Lord Yu.

23:00.900 --> 23:01.770
No one else is to touch it.

23:01.940 --> 23:02.449
Understood?

23:02.491 --> 23:02.811
Got it.

23:02.900 --> 23:03.250
Go on!

23:08.980 --> 23:10.010
A little more.

23:10.490 --> 23:11.140
Honestly!

23:13.290 --> 23:13.940
You scared me!

23:14.490 --> 23:15.250
I'm sorry.

23:18.900 --> 23:20.420
Oh, it's Wenji.

23:21.180 --> 23:22.290
I'm not worthy of that.

23:22.980 --> 23:25.570
You're a big shot now.

23:29.050 --> 23:29.660
Excuse me.

23:32.380 --> 23:33.330
That's right.

23:33.730 --> 23:34.940
You're a man of importance now.

23:35.220 --> 23:36.660
Of course you don't have time for us.

23:37.730 --> 23:38.250
All right.

23:38.810 --> 23:39.380
Go on.

23:59.420 --> 24:01.420
I study late until midnight,

24:01.940 --> 24:03.530
learning characters.

24:03.770 --> 24:06.570
Even now, I can only make out
sixty or seventy percent of the gazette.

24:07.730 --> 24:08.420
Tell me,

24:09.810 --> 24:11.090
why does he know so many characters?

24:11.530 --> 24:13.420
Ever since he met Lord Yu,

24:13.980 --> 24:16.460
he's been acting like a big shot.

24:25.860 --> 24:26.860
The Central Circuit's military governor
is here!

24:40.660 --> 24:42.140
I forgot to warn you last night.

24:43.490 --> 24:45.700
If you want to keep your position,

24:48.290 --> 24:49.940
stay away from Mu Wanyao.

24:53.530 --> 24:54.570
General, you've got the wrong man.

24:55.380 --> 24:55.860
Last night,

24:56.460 --> 24:57.620
we never met.

25:01.730 --> 25:02.530
The military governor is here!

25:04.140 --> 25:05.199
The military governor is here!

25:05.241 --> 25:06.441
- It's Governor Mu!
- Where is he?

25:19.540 --> 25:23.740
(Mu Xianqing, Military Governor
of North Jing's Eastern Circuit)

25:33.660 --> 25:34.420
Governor Mu,

25:35.490 --> 25:36.220
it's been a while.

25:37.530 --> 25:38.730
But that's strange.

25:39.700 --> 25:41.570
I thought you'd get here before me.

25:44.050 --> 25:46.660
A brat really does move faster
than his elders.

26:23.860 --> 26:25.660
What an exquisite spread.

26:27.290 --> 26:28.050
The carvings are beautiful.

26:29.530 --> 26:30.309
It's been a while.

26:30.351 --> 26:30.768
It's been a while.

26:30.810 --> 26:31.770
It's been a while.

26:33.140 --> 26:34.090
Your Highness.

26:35.420 --> 26:36.980
Your Highness.

26:39.250 --> 26:40.220
Come on, Chunhua.

26:41.250 --> 26:42.330
Your Highness.

26:44.700 --> 26:45.220
Are you tired?

26:53.620 --> 26:54.490
Careful.

27:02.490 --> 27:03.010
Stand up!

27:14.140 --> 27:14.770
What a strong wind.

27:15.380 --> 27:16.010
It's freezing.

27:17.250 --> 27:18.620
The wind cuts right through you.

27:21.940 --> 27:22.770
How much longer must we wait?

27:23.620 --> 27:24.530
My hands are frozen.

27:25.090 --> 27:25.860
Who knows?

27:26.980 --> 27:28.250
Honestly, my hands are frozen solid.

27:50.810 --> 27:51.140
Mr. Wei.

27:56.660 --> 27:57.220
Hot eggs?

27:57.770 --> 27:58.330
Where'd you get them?

27:59.050 --> 27:59.700
Warm up your hands.

28:06.980 --> 28:08.860
Chunhua should stay home and rest.

28:09.140 --> 28:10.359
She'd be in a much better mood

28:10.401 --> 28:11.681
if you weren't hovering over her.

28:12.090 --> 28:12.940
But look,

28:13.490 --> 28:14.700
you just had to bring her along,

28:15.250 --> 28:16.900
without a thought for us women.

28:17.730 --> 28:18.700
I'm fine, Your Highness.

28:21.140 --> 28:22.250
Here, have some.

28:23.010 --> 28:23.530
Give me that.

28:35.250 --> 28:36.290
This tastes better.

29:40.700 --> 29:41.810
(Why is he here?)

29:50.050 --> 29:51.330
(Why is he dressed as a eunuch?)

29:55.290 --> 29:55.730
Chunhua?

29:57.460 --> 29:57.940
Chunhua?

30:00.940 --> 30:01.900
Why aren't you eating?

30:02.730 --> 30:03.420
Let me feed you.

30:10.290 --> 30:11.050
I beg to be excused

30:11.620 --> 30:12.330
for a moment.

30:13.980 --> 30:14.250
Chunhua...

30:18.250 --> 30:19.290
Still eating?

30:20.010 --> 30:21.330
Go check on her.

30:30.050 --> 30:31.140
You little brat!

30:31.900 --> 30:33.290
Did you do it?

30:33.490 --> 30:33.900
I didn't do it!

30:34.330 --> 30:35.330
It wasn't me...

30:35.730 --> 30:36.119
I'm innocent...

30:36.161 --> 30:37.351
Tell me. Was it you?

30:37.900 --> 30:38.879
I swear it wasn't me!

30:38.921 --> 30:39.351
You still...

30:41.050 --> 30:41.490
Admit it!

30:42.180 --> 30:43.570
It wasn't me!

30:43.900 --> 30:44.700
Liu Wenji.

30:45.980 --> 30:48.180
A glass goblet just went missing.

30:48.700 --> 30:49.530
Did you take it?

30:50.700 --> 30:51.420
What goblet?

30:51.860 --> 30:53.229
When you came in,

30:53.271 --> 30:55.201
you were holding one.

30:56.570 --> 30:58.180
So it was you, Liu Wenji!

30:58.730 --> 30:59.730
The banquet's about to begin.

30:59.860 --> 31:02.180
Hurry! Hand over the goblet!

31:02.860 --> 31:03.490
I remember

31:04.050 --> 31:05.330
I left it right there.

31:06.220 --> 31:08.090
I didn't take it when I went out.

31:08.730 --> 31:09.770
Didn't you hear?

31:10.900 --> 31:13.359
Mr. Wang saw you with it.

31:13.401 --> 31:15.031
Still denying it?

31:17.050 --> 31:17.810
I really didn't take it.

31:19.980 --> 31:21.050
Now I see.

31:21.900 --> 31:23.509
Liu Wenji was acting strange

31:23.551 --> 31:25.351
all morning,

31:25.770 --> 31:26.860
hovering around the table.

31:27.140 --> 31:30.460
He must've waited
till everyone was busy,

31:30.570 --> 31:33.570
snatched a goblet,

31:33.700 --> 31:35.530
slipped it up his sleeve,

31:36.010 --> 31:37.490
and thought no one would notice.

31:37.770 --> 31:38.290
Am I right?

31:45.380 --> 31:46.090
Search me if you like.

31:48.290 --> 31:49.380
Who'd be stupid enough

31:49.980 --> 31:51.220
to carry stolen goods on them?

31:51.810 --> 31:52.940
You stepped out just now

31:53.250 --> 31:55.620
and have hidden it somewhere.

32:00.250 --> 32:01.010
I swear I didn't take it.

32:01.860 --> 32:02.660
Please investigate

32:03.090 --> 32:03.900
and clear my name.

32:05.090 --> 32:07.010
Still being stubborn?

32:07.530 --> 32:08.620
You won't confess?

32:09.250 --> 32:09.810
Guards!

32:12.380 --> 32:12.770
Seize him!

32:13.180 --> 32:13.620
Hold him down!

32:16.980 --> 32:17.860
Your word isn't proof.

32:18.090 --> 32:19.460
What makes you think I took it?

32:19.620 --> 32:19.980
What?

32:20.460 --> 32:21.620
You want proof?

32:21.980 --> 32:22.530
Fine.

32:22.810 --> 32:24.860
Then I'll prove it right now!

32:25.220 --> 32:25.860
What's all the shouting?

32:27.420 --> 32:28.570
Making such a scene.

32:28.770 --> 32:29.420
I'm warning you,

32:29.490 --> 32:31.269
if you disturb the noble guests,

32:31.311 --> 32:32.369
your punishment will be even worse!

32:32.411 --> 32:33.561
I said I didn't do it!

32:33.660 --> 32:34.119
Let me go!

32:34.161 --> 32:35.071
Shut up!

32:35.180 --> 32:36.810
- Let go...
- Stop making a scene!

32:36.940 --> 32:37.530
Mr. Han.

32:39.140 --> 32:41.359
How does palace law deal with

32:41.401 --> 32:43.351
a thief like this?

32:44.050 --> 32:44.660
Rest assured.

32:44.730 --> 32:45.730
I know the rules.

32:46.090 --> 32:47.229
First, break his legs,

32:47.271 --> 32:48.961
then throw him out of the palace.

32:50.860 --> 32:51.420
Let me go!

32:52.220 --> 32:52.770
What right do you have?

32:53.090 --> 32:54.481
- Why are you framing me?
- Look at me!

32:54.530 --> 32:55.309
- Why frame me?
- Look at me!

32:55.351 --> 32:55.989
- Look at me!
- Why...

32:56.031 --> 32:57.241
I said look at me!

32:58.290 --> 33:00.530
I knew you were an ungrateful snake.

33:00.730 --> 33:01.359
I didn't expect you

33:01.401 --> 33:02.969
to show your true colors so soon!

33:03.011 --> 33:04.041
I said I didn't do it!

33:04.140 --> 33:04.770
Let me go!

33:05.010 --> 33:05.749
Listen here.

33:05.791 --> 33:07.161
I've hated the sight of you for ages!

33:07.220 --> 33:08.989
I'll teach you a lesson today!

33:09.031 --> 33:09.799
I told you I didn't take it.

33:09.841 --> 33:10.321
Let him go!

33:23.620 --> 33:25.380
Who... who are you?

33:26.980 --> 33:27.530
Chunhua.

33:27.860 --> 33:28.730
Hurry!

33:31.140 --> 33:31.940
Greetings, Your Highness.

33:32.860 --> 33:33.860
What are you doing here?

33:35.050 --> 33:36.250
It's filthy here.

33:36.420 --> 33:37.490
Why'd you come here?

33:47.250 --> 33:47.730
Your Highness,

33:51.220 --> 33:52.180
I've caused trouble.

33:53.220 --> 33:54.420
Please forgive me.

33:56.010 --> 33:57.010
Wh-What happened?

33:58.900 --> 33:59.490
Just now,

34:00.380 --> 34:03.010
I saw how pretty
that eunuch's glass goblet was,

34:03.490 --> 34:04.490
so I took it.

34:05.290 --> 34:06.530
Then I accidentally

34:06.810 --> 34:08.210
dropped it into the pond.

34:09.980 --> 34:11.050
Well, accidents happen.

34:11.780 --> 34:12.650
If you like it,

34:13.490 --> 34:15.090
I'll send you a bunch.

34:15.460 --> 34:16.010
But

34:17.340 --> 34:18.300
these eunuchs

34:18.820 --> 34:20.340
are making such a fuss over it.

34:24.490 --> 34:25.420
It's just a cup.

34:26.380 --> 34:28.010
Let's say I dropped it by accident.

34:29.610 --> 34:30.740
No big deal.

34:32.650 --> 34:33.340
Back to your places.

34:33.820 --> 34:34.300
Understood.

34:35.740 --> 34:36.460
Move along.

34:36.820 --> 34:37.420
Easy now.

34:37.980 --> 34:38.420
Easy.

34:39.090 --> 34:39.860
Careful!

34:43.130 --> 34:43.690
Easy.

34:44.210 --> 34:44.820
Easy.

35:13.820 --> 35:15.090
Greetings, Your Highness.

35:16.860 --> 35:17.420
Watch your step.

35:21.010 --> 35:21.650
Chunhua, look.

35:23.050 --> 35:23.570
A toad.

35:26.940 --> 35:27.530
Oh, it's dead.

35:37.460 --> 35:37.690
You...

35:38.210 --> 35:39.380
Why are you being shy?

35:43.980 --> 35:44.780
You're a prince

35:45.170 --> 35:46.010
of noble status.

35:46.570 --> 35:47.610
Hurry back to your seat.

35:48.740 --> 35:49.900
I just threw up.

35:50.300 --> 35:51.460
I need some fresh air.

35:55.650 --> 35:57.260
Then... come find me soon.

35:58.260 --> 35:58.940
Hurry.

36:22.320 --> 36:25.280
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

36:26.130 --> 36:27.090
So it really was you.

36:27.090 --> 36:30.080
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

36:30.550 --> 36:34.480
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

36:34.530 --> 36:37.750
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

36:38.850 --> 36:41.400
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

36:42.520 --> 36:46.230
♪Time lies sealed
beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

36:47.360 --> 36:49.010
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

36:49.010 --> 36:49.340
Wait.

36:51.140 --> 36:54.060
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

36:59.340 --> 37:00.340
We're already on different paths.

37:01.530 --> 37:03.770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

37:03.820 --> 37:04.820
Why did you help me?

37:05.900 --> 37:07.130
No matter what you become,

37:07.172 --> 37:09.672
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

37:09.900 --> 37:10.690
I won't change.

37:11.860 --> 37:12.980
I never did,

37:15.490 --> 37:16.530
and I never will.

37:18.130 --> 37:20.580
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

37:22.210 --> 37:23.460
You know, even if you help me,

37:23.740 --> 37:26.070
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

37:26.900 --> 37:27.860
I won't thank you.

37:33.780 --> 37:34.420
I'm helping you

37:35.900 --> 37:37.980
because losing a cup
won't cost me anything.

37:39.490 --> 37:41.170
But if you're framed,
you'll lose your life.

37:42.300 --> 37:43.300
I don't need your gratitude.

37:45.490 --> 37:46.570
I just want you to live well.

37:48.610 --> 37:50.430
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

37:50.580 --> 37:52.850
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

37:53.340 --> 37:55.910
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

37:57.030 --> 38:00.700
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

38:01.510 --> 38:03.880
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

38:05.110 --> 38:07.080
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

38:07.130 --> 38:08.740
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

38:09.760 --> 38:11.990
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

38:16.690 --> 38:17.090
(Chunhua...)

38:19.530 --> 38:20.300
(If one day)

38:22.490 --> 38:24.090
(I rise above them all,)

38:25.980 --> 38:28.218
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

38:28.260 --> 38:28.879
(would we)

38:28.921 --> 38:30.441
(no longer have to live this way?)

38:32.550 --> 38:37.560
♪How sweet the spring,
how hard to leave♪

38:39.460 --> 38:40.239
Indeed.

38:40.281 --> 38:41.801
What a feast today.

38:44.690 --> 38:46.530
Your Royal Highness.

38:48.740 --> 38:50.210
Your Highness.

39:10.050 --> 39:12.610
His Majesty has arrived!

39:26.340 --> 39:28.460
Greetings, Your Majesty!

39:30.740 --> 39:31.380
Please, be seated.

39:32.170 --> 39:33.940
Thank you, Your Majesty!

40:32.170 --> 40:38.610
Greetings, Lord Yu!

40:45.060 --> 40:48.100
(Zhao Zongze, General of the Left
Imperial Guard, Zhao Lingfei's Father)

41:03.940 --> 41:04.530
Come on.

41:05.170 --> 41:05.780
Hurry.

41:35.090 --> 41:35.490
Your Majesty.

41:36.090 --> 41:37.490
Forgive me for keeping you waiting.

41:38.690 --> 41:39.130
No matter.

41:52.260 --> 41:53.690
Long live

41:56.010 --> 41:56.740
Your Majesty!

41:57.460 --> 41:59.420
Long live Your Majesty!

41:59.650 --> 42:02.490
Long live Your Majesty!

42:02.900 --> 42:05.090
The Chief of the Court
of State Ceremonial presents

42:05.490 --> 42:08.050
a collection of birthday greetings
from various nations

42:08.300 --> 42:10.460
in a gilded box!

42:11.340 --> 42:13.300
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
presents

42:13.740 --> 42:17.570
three volumes of the newly composed
"Longevity Movement."

42:24.980 --> 42:25.780
Princess Danyang.

42:26.380 --> 42:27.940
Your birthday gifts each year

42:28.780 --> 42:29.900
are always so original.

42:30.340 --> 42:32.380
What have you prepared this year?

42:44.300 --> 42:45.210
What's this?

42:47.610 --> 42:48.210
Father,

42:48.740 --> 42:51.050
this precious stone comes
from Mount Lufu,

42:51.610 --> 42:53.340
where I prayed for Mother.

42:53.900 --> 42:55.690
After bringing it back,
I found skilled craftsmen

42:56.010 --> 42:57.210
to carve it into this inkstone.

42:57.740 --> 42:59.490
The carving took some time,

42:59.860 --> 43:01.460
but thankfully, it's ready for today.

43:01.860 --> 43:03.610
Wanyao, how thoughtful of you.

43:07.940 --> 43:08.740
What a coincidence.

43:09.460 --> 43:11.460
It seems I'm destined
to cross paths with Princess Danyang.

43:12.170 --> 43:12.570
Your Majesty,

43:14.300 --> 43:15.900
my gift is also made of stone.

43:17.980 --> 43:18.740
However,

43:20.050 --> 43:22.010
it surely pales in comparison
to Princess Danyang's fine gift.

43:22.740 --> 43:23.460
I hope Your Majesty

43:24.050 --> 43:25.010
will forgive its roughness.

43:26.420 --> 43:26.860
Bring it in!

43:34.980 --> 43:35.980
What's that enormous thing?

43:52.820 --> 43:53.650
What is it?

43:55.420 --> 43:57.130
It's a stone stele

43:57.740 --> 43:58.780
from the Central Circuit.

44:00.420 --> 44:02.690
After a century of wind and rain,
it still stands firm.

44:04.050 --> 44:05.210
A fitting gift to wish Your Majesty

44:05.820 --> 44:06.780
many more years of life.

44:08.260 --> 44:09.460
How thoughtful, General.

44:16.090 --> 44:17.260
Your Majesty, why not ask

44:19.010 --> 44:21.010
what's so special about this stele?

44:27.530 --> 44:28.669
It and the merit stele

44:28.711 --> 44:31.321
the court erected in North Jing
over a decade ago

44:33.090 --> 44:34.260
come from the same place.

44:35.900 --> 44:38.170
They're two halves of the same stone.

44:38.490 --> 44:39.740
It's... the merit stele!

44:39.980 --> 44:40.380
Oh...

44:41.530 --> 44:42.780
Mr. Yan.

44:43.820 --> 44:44.420
Could he mean

44:44.860 --> 44:46.460
the stele from the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors?

44:46.740 --> 44:48.210
The Shence Army marched
on North Jing back then

44:48.490 --> 44:50.130
and suffered heavy losses
before barely defeating the rebels.

44:50.690 --> 44:51.820
They carved a stele there
to commemorate their victory.

44:53.210 --> 44:54.210
So he's...

44:55.130 --> 44:56.090
challenging the court?

44:58.340 --> 44:58.860
Exactly.

44:59.460 --> 45:01.780
Meng Zaishi now commands
a hundred thousand troops.

45:02.170 --> 45:03.210
At his command,

45:03.530 --> 45:05.690
they could march straight on Sheng'an.

45:06.300 --> 45:07.130
If war breaks out again,

45:07.490 --> 45:08.650
victory is far from certain.

45:09.090 --> 45:10.170
So this stele

45:10.820 --> 45:11.780
isn't a birthday gift.

45:12.530 --> 45:13.570
It's an insult.

45:14.570 --> 45:16.050
As the saying goes,
one good turn deserves another.

45:16.460 --> 45:17.650
Since they share the same origin,

45:18.050 --> 45:19.130
how could I not return the favor?

45:19.610 --> 45:20.090
And besides,

45:21.130 --> 45:22.189
a little stone stele

45:22.231 --> 45:23.801
hardly conveys my sincerity.

45:24.570 --> 45:25.530
I've already ordered

45:25.900 --> 45:28.460
my Central Circuit troops at the border

45:30.900 --> 45:32.010
to join me in wishing Your Majesty

45:32.740 --> 45:34.010
a long and prosperous reign.

45:35.620 --> 45:40.259
(Next Episode Preview)

45:40.301 --> 45:41.171
I beg Your Majesty

45:41.460 --> 45:43.420
to grant me Princess Danyang's hand.

45:43.820 --> 45:44.860
Father, I have something to say.

45:45.050 --> 45:46.650
It's the perfect time for a hunt.

45:46.900 --> 45:48.090
Why not have him compete

45:48.300 --> 45:49.900
with the other suitors here?

45:49.980 --> 45:51.170
Whoever wins,

45:51.690 --> 45:53.820
I'll marry him.

45:57.640 --> 46:00.933
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:03.618 --> 46:08.534
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:10.728 --> 46:16.573
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:17.073 --> 46:22.299
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:25.068 --> 46:29.859
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:30.695 --> 46:36.774
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:38.575 --> 46:41.725
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:41.725 --> 46:43.373
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:43.425 --> 46:47.149
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:47.527 --> 46:52.193
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:52.812 --> 46:56.853
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:57.344 --> 46:59.459
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:59.499 --> 47:06.445
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:07.208 --> 47:10.661
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:10.841 --> 47:13.986
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:14.425 --> 47:21.062
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:21.459 --> 47:23.497
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:23.497 --> 47:25.973
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:26.011 --> 47:28.480
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:28.684 --> 47:35.571
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:35.883 --> 47:39.154
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:39.459 --> 47:42.632
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:42.956 --> 47:46.382
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:46.615 --> 47:49.840
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:50.171 --> 47:56.967
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:57.336 --> 47:59.398
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:59.399 --> 48:01.902
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:01.949 --> 48:04.287
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:04.518 --> 48:11.353
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:11.702 --> 48:13.320
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:13.450 --> 48:15.246
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:15.603 --> 48:18.620
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:18.660 --> 48:19.987
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
